au.edu/flagstaff-campus/cline-library/learning-study-spaces/","source_title":"Cline Library learning and study spaces","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The library says the MakerLab is available during regular library hours; verify current access before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_native_american_cultural_center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Native American Cultural Center","title":"Locate the Native American Cultural Center","subtitle":"Saturday late morning • Building 14","notes":"Add this center to your campus map and review its current programs before attending. Treat public programs as opportunities to listen, learn, and follow host guidance.","short_summary":"A named NAU center serving Indigenous students and the wider campus community.","evidence_claim":"NAU’s Native American Cultural Center is a campus facility that supports student organizations, recruitment, retention, and community engagement.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/stories/nau-native-american-cultural-center/","source_title":"Culture, care, and community","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Confirm current programs and access guidance with the center before making a special trip.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_health_learning_center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"John Haeger Health and Learning Center Recreation Center","title":"Get familiar with the Recreation Center","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • Building 25","notes":"Find the Recreation Center in the Health and Learning Center, then check the current membership and facility rules before planning a workout or activity.","short_summary":"NAU’s recreation hub with fitness, courts, climbing, and study areas.","evidence_claim":"NAU states that its Recreation Center is located in the John Haeger Health and Learning Center and includes fitness and recreational amenities.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/flagstaff-campus/campus-recreation/","source_title":"Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"NAU lists the Recreation Center at 824 S. San Francisco St.; access requirements depend on current enrollment or membership status.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_observatory_field_complex","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Observatory Field Complex","title":"Walk by Observatory Field Complex","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon • University Drive and San Francisco Street","notes":"Use this outdoor landmark to connect campus routes in daylight. If you want to play, check whether the fields are available rather than assuming open access.","short_summary":"A central-campus field complex for open play and pickup games.","evidence_claim":"NAU identifies Observatory Field Complex at University Drive and San Francisco Street and describes it as a central-campus mix of turf and natural grass fields.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/flagstaff-campus/campus-recreation/","source_title":"Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Field availability and reservations can change; check with Campus Recreation before participating.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_ardrey_memorial_auditorium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ardrey Memorial Auditorium","title":"Check what is on at Ardrey","subtitle":"Saturday evening • Performing and Fine Arts","notes":"Look up the current calendar and ticket details for an event that suits your weekend. Even a brief walk to the venue makes its location familiar for future performances.","short_summary":"NAU’s largest performing-arts center in northern Arizona.","evidence_claim":"NAU says Ardrey Memorial Auditorium is located at the center of campus and hosts a wide variety of events each year.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/college-arts-letters/events/performance-venues/","source_title":"Performance venues","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Events and admissions vary; use the official Central Ticket Office information linked by NAU before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_south_field_complex","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"South Field Complex","title":"Find South Field Complex in daylight","subtitle":"Sunday morning • Pine Knoll Drive and South Huffer Lane","notes":"Make a daytime loop to this named complex and use it as a navigation reference. Reserve or confirm access before organizing any group activity on the fields.","short_summary":"An NAU outdoor recreation complex with turf fields and disc golf.","evidence_claim":"NAU says South Field Complex at Pine Knoll Drive and South Huffer Lane includes two lit artificial-turf fields, sand volleyball courts, and an 18-hole disc golf course.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/flagstaff-campus/campus-recreation/","source_title":"Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Campus Recreation manages reservations; check current access and field conditions before using facilities.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"nau_lumberjack_athletics","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"NAU Lumberjack Athletics","title":"Check the Lumberjack schedule","subtitle":"Sunday • choose a future home event","notes":"Browse the official athletics schedule together and save one future home event. Confirm venue rules and ticket details when you select a date rather than relying on old information.","short_summary":"An official route to NAU Division I team information and schedules.","evidence_claim":"NAU identifies its Lumberjacks as competing in 15 NCAA Division I sports in the Big Sky Conference.","source_url":"https://nau.edu/flagstaff-campus/sports-athletics/","source_title":"Sports and athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Schedules, venues, ticketing, and entry policies vary by event; verify them on official NAU Athletics channels.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
